{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2022-11-22 08:02:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR SUCCESSFULLY DEMONSTRATES FIRST BATTERY ELECTRIC LARGE MINING TRUCK AND INVESTS IN SUSTAINABLE PROVING GROUND', 'text': "IRVING, TEXAS , NOV. 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) ANNOUNCED TODAY A SUCCESSFUL DEMONSTRATION OF ITS FIRST BATTERY ELECTRIC 793 LARGE MINING TRUCK AND A SIGNIFICANT INVESTMENT TO TRANSFORM ITS ARIZONA-BASED PROVING GROUND INTO A SUSTAINABLE TESTING AND VALIDATION HUB OF THE FUTURE. \xa0 CATERPILLAR COMPLETED DEVELOPMENT OF ITS FIRST BATTERY ELECTRIC 793 PROTOTYPE WITH SUPPORT FROM KEY MINING CUSTOMERS PARTICIPATING IN CATERPILLAR'S EARLY LEARNER PROGRAM."}